{"seq":3,"slug":"bayes-theorem","title":"贝叶斯定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/probability-foundations/bayes-theorem","wordCount":698,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯定理\">贝叶斯定理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>贝叶斯定理是概率论中最具应用价值的定理，它描述了如何用新证据更新信念。公式 P(H|E) = P(E|H)P(H) / P(E) 将先验概率 P(H) 通过似然 P(E|H) 更新为后验概率 P(H|E)。</p>\n<p>贝叶斯定理不仅是一个数学公式，更是一种认识论框架——它形式化了&quot;根据证据修正信念&quot;的过程。在机器学习中，贝叶斯方法提供了不确定性量化、正则化解释和模型选择的统一框架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;先验 P(H)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;贝叶斯更新&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;似然 P(E|H)&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    D[&quot;证据 P(E)&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;后验 P(H|E)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[新的先验]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;P(H|E) = P(E|H)P(H)/P(E)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"先验 P(H)\"] --&gt; B[\"贝叶斯更新\"]\n    C[\"似然 P(E|H)\"] --&gt; B\n    D[\"证据 P(E)\"] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E[\"后验 P(H|E)\"]\n    E --&gt; F[新的先验]\n    F --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; G[\"P(H|E) = P(E|H)P(H)/P(E)\"]</pre><p>| 术语      | 含义             | 公式位置         | 编程对应   |\n| --------- | ---------------- | ---------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| 先验 P(H) | 看到证据前的信念 | 分子因子         | 初始参数   |\n| 似然 P(E  | H)               | 假设下证据的概率 | 分子因子   | 模型输出   |\n| 证据 P(E) | 证据的边际概率   | 分母             | 归一化常数 |\n| 后验 P(H  | E)               | 看到证据后的信念 | 结果       | 更新后参数 |</p>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯定理的推导与应用\">贝叶斯定理的推导与应用</h2><p>贝叶斯定理从条件概率定义直接推出：P(H|E) = P(H∩E)/P(E) = P(E|H)P(H)/P(E)。分母 P(E) 通过全概率公式计算：P(E) = Σ P(E|Hᵢ)P(Hᵢ)。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const bayesUpdate = (prior: number, likelihood: number, evidence: number): number =&gt; (likelihood * prior) / evidence;&#10;&#10;const bayesWithPartition = (priors: number[], likelihoods: number[], targetIdx: number): number =&gt; {&#10;  const evidence = priors.reduce((s, p, i) =&gt; s + likelihoods[i] * p, 0);&#10;  return (likelihoods[targetIdx] * priors[targetIdx]) / evidence;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const spamFilter = (pSpam: number, wordLikelihoods: { spam: number; ham: number }[]): number =&gt; {&#10;  let logOdds = Math.log(pSpam / (1 - pSpam));&#10;  for (const word of wordLikelihoods) {&#10;    logOdds += Math.log(word.spam / word.ham);&#10;  }&#10;  return 1 / (1 + Math.exp(-logOdds));&#10;};&#10;&#10;const words = [&#10;  { spam: 0.8, ham: 0.1 },&#10;  { spam: 0.6, ham: 0.2 },&#10;  { spam: 0.3, ham: 0.5 },&#10;];&#10;console.log(&#39;垃圾邮件概率:&#39;, spamFilter(0.3, words).toFixed(4));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bayesUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">likelihood</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (likelihood </span><span style=\"color:#